{"data": [{"author_id": "2179993409", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:33:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113504110721028330"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 56, "start": 51, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 125, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/l4iAFGfYqP"}]}, "id": "2113504110721028330", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 185, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Base editing and now prime editing:\nPrime Medicine $PRME has treated the first person earlier this month (Wilson's disease) (https://t.co/l4iAFGfYqP)", "url": "https://x.com/EGutlederer/status/2113504110721028330"}, {"author_id": "222363892", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:23:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113682797588086933"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/nature/status/…", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/nature/status/2113355702345363659", "start": 121, "url": "https://t.co/tzTtwf7kGG"}]}, "id": "2113682797588086933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113355702345363659", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "First for in vivo prime editing but in vivo knockout and base editing at dna lvl has been done many times/for years now… https://t.co/tzTtwf7kGG", "url": "https://x.com/dshahh/status/2113682797588086933"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113408100162035712"]}, "author_id": "2060252048965451776", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:12:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113408102645022898"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/j7QdtTMe10", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/exfilnews/status/2113408102645022898/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113408100162035712", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/j7QdtTMe10"}]}, "id": "2113408102645022898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 232, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime editing was first described in Nature in October 2019. Seven years on, Prime Medicine says it has used it inside a person for the first time, rewriting liver DNA in a Wilson disease trial. Per Nature, base editing can't fix the commonest ATP7B mutations. Results due 2027. https://t.co/j7QdtTMe10", "url": "https://x.com/exfilnews/status/2113408102645022898"}, {"author_id": "4323361101", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:04:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113451459974946914"], "id": "2113451459974946914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 524, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "￼The method called prime editing can make fine-scale edits to DNA 🧬 \n\nA powerful gene-editing technique has been used to edit DNA directly in a person’s body — the first known instance of such a treatment.\n\nA first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the", "url": "https://x.com/DocpalFrancesc2/status/2113451459974946914"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113711291474776064"]}, "author_id": "833676941702078464", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:16:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113711302178669038"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/yOJCwXPHwa", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/drkaanyl/status/2113711302178669038/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113711291474776064", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/yOJCwXPHwa"}]}, "id": "2113711302178669038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2138, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Prime editing ilk kez insan vücudunda DNA’yı doğrudan düzeltti.\nPrime Medicine, Wilson hastalığına yönelik klinik denemesinde ilk hastaya prime editing tedavisi uyguladı. Bu, tekniğin vücut içinde (in vivo) kullanıldığı bilinen ilk örnek.\nWilson hastalığı, ATP7B genindeki https://t.co/yOJCwXPHwa", "url": "https://x.com/drkaanyl/status/2113711302178669038"}, {"author_id": "1113068103813005312", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:47:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113643437404917862"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/92993048903235…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/929930489032355840/status/2113636633040039975", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/Dh4irOsniu"}]}, "id": "2113643437404917862", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 88, "impression_count": 20063, "like_count": 479, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 19}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113636633040039975", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "JUST IN: Scientists have used prime editing directly inside the human body for the first time.\n\nPrime editing (unlike traditional CRISPR which cuts DNA) allows scientists to precisely re-write individual letters of our genetic code.\n\nThis could allow us to fix genetic mutations https://t.co/Dh4irOsniu", "url": "https://x.com/superpower/status/2113643437404917862"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113634286406434816"]}, "author_id": "1683208137489227776", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:10:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113634291485638799"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7y5fCi2mHG", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/guilleflorvs/status/2113634291485638799/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113634286406434816", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/7y5fCi2mHG"}]}, "id": "2113634291485638799", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 881, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "BREAKING: For the first time in history, a patient's DNA was edited directly inside their body to treat disease.\n\nPrime Medicine just dosed the first patient in a clinical trial using prime editing to rewrite liver cell DNA and eliminate a copper-transport mutation causing https://t.co/7y5fCi2mHG", "url": "https://x.com/guilleflorvs/status/2113634291485638799"}, {"author_id": "228784853", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:33:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113624797359779945"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 62, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 39, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/RnRXSNK5MQ"}]}, "id": "2113624797359779945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CRISPr Prime Editing of DNA a success: https://t.co/RnRXSNK5MQ", "ur