: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body https://t.co/jW6Z807WIl", "url": "https://x.com/WandZFoundation/status/2113534080096555205"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113609608325423104"]}, "author_id": "3155350124", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:33:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113609732623573151"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 167, "id": "15862891", "start": 160, "username": "Nature"}, {"end": 186, "id": "1513561532948525062", "start": 172, "username": "PrimeMedicine"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/idolaov82w", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/paddleurway/status/2113609732623573151/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113609608325423104", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/idolaov82w"}]}, "id": "2113609732623573151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One-time cures for rare genetic diseases just went from \"if\" to \"when.\"\n\nFor the first time, prime editing has rewritten DNA inside a living person's body, per @Nature.\n\n• @PrimeMedicine dosed its first Wilson disease patient this month\n• One IV infusion carries the editor to https://t.co/idolaov82w", "url": "https://x.com/paddleurway/status/2113609732623573151"}, {"author_id": "1867502223758086144", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:20:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113651876352667762"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 236, "start": 229, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 250, "start": 237, "tag": "PrimeEditing"}]}, "id": "2113651876352667762", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime Medicine has launched the first in-body prime editing trial for Wilson disease, marking a significant advancement in CRISPR medicine. This trial represents the first instance of DNA being rewritten inside a patient's body. #CRISPR #PrimeEditing", "url": "https://x.com/NewsEdition_1/status/2113651876352667762"}, {"author_id": "14562968", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:40:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385128248385884"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 244, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 221, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/ofhBnVXUJk"}]}, "id": "2113385128248385884", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1902, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body\n\nApplication of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.\n\nhttps://t.co/ofhBnVXUJk", "url": "https://x.com/weldeiry/status/2113385128248385884"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2113651099920171008"]}, "author_id": "2909471077", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:17:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113651106853310882"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Xl7RGKhyLn", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GoodNewsDailySW/status/2113651106853310882/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2113651099920171008", "start": 245, "url": "https://t.co/Xl7RGKhyLn"}]}, "id": "2113651106853310882", "public_me